01:21.852 --> 01:24.030
I can personally, you know

01:24.030 --> 01:27.060
delete this file or edit this file.

01:27.060 --> 01:30.150
I can download it, I can share it with people

01:30.150 --> 01:32.490
they can fork it and star it.

01:32.490 --> 01:34.810
So I'll show you, if I go to all gists

01:35.910 --> 01:38.430
I can see a discovery page.

01:38.430 --> 01:41.430
